          "block_header": "<!-- p -->",
          "author_transcribed_row": "为了证明它，我们讨论函数 $y=\\frac{\\ln x}{x^{\\frac{p}{2}}}$，并且考察当 $x>1$ 时",
          "formula_printed_breaks": 0
