        {
          "md_line": 51,
          "block_header": "<!-- p -->",
          "author_transcribed_row": "当 $x\\in]1,e^{\\frac{2}{p}}[$ 时，它取正值，而当 $x\\in]e^{\\frac{2}{p}},\\infty[$ 时，它取负值. 于",
          "formula_printed_breaks": 0
        },
        {
          "md_line": 52,
          "block_header": "<!-- p -->",
          "author_transcribed_row": "是，在点 $e^{\\frac{2}{p}}$，所讨论的函数取极大值，我们用字母 $M$ 表示它.",
          "formula_printed_breaks": 0
        },
        {
          "md_line": 53,
          "block_header": "<!-- p -->",
          "author_transcribed_row": "对于所有的 $x>1$，",
          "formula_printed_breaks": 0
        },
        {
          "md_line": 54,
